  "id": "numerical-ability",
  "term": "numerical ability",
  "definition": "Numerical ability is the capacity to work with numbers, especially for calculation, in ways that support learning mathematics. It is distinct from broader mathematical ability because it also involves using number skills in everyday tasks such as counting, selling, and buying.",
